<EchoMarketingShell
  title="Pricing"
  eyebrow="Hosted, free, BYOK, local"
  description="EchoAI pricing is designed around flexible model access: a free entry lane, hosted premium credits, BYOK provider keys, and local desktop execution."
>
  <section class="echo-grid">
    <article class="echo-card span-3"><h2>Free</h2><p>Free model routing, basic web chat, local CLI usage, and limited project storage.</p></article>
    <article class="echo-card span-3"><h2>Pro</h2><p>Hosted premium credits, automations, outputs, memory, knowledge, and device sync.</p></article>
    <article class="echo-card span-3"><h2>Team</h2><p>Shared workspace, roles, managed vault, audit logs, and collaboration controls.</p></article>
    <article class="echo-card span-3"><h2>Enterprise</h2><p>SSO, private deployment, custom retention, support, and compliance workflows.</p></article>
  </section>
</EchoMarketingShell>

